data: {"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"### c49cc699-c623-5074-a9a1-249d7d65de5e\n`uniswap-v4@1.0.2` · repo:46c6834698c48bc4a463a86d8420f4eb1d7f3b75 · as_of 2026-04-02T19:42:06Z\nhttps://github.com/Uniswap/v4-core/blob/46c6834698c48bc4a463a86d8420f4eb1d7f3b75/README.md#L44-L66\n\n```\nUniswap v4 Core › Repository Structure\nAll contracts are held within the `v4-core/src` folder.\n\nNote that helper contracts used by tests are held in the `v4-core/src/test` subfolder within the `src` folder. Any new test helper contracts should be added here, but all foundry tests are in the…\n```\n\n### uniswap-v3@3.0.0::TestUniswapV3Callee::__contract__\n`uniswap-v3@3.0.0` · repo:d0831dc6b8a318df3872b6d68f6de135c9f3ec29 · as_of 2026-04-30T16:18:48Z\nhttps://github.com/Uniswap/v3-core/blob/d0831dc6b8a318df3872b6d68f6de135c9f3ec29/contracts/test/TestUniswapV3Callee.sol#L15-L15\n\n```\ncontract TestUniswapV3Callee is IUniswapV3MintCallback, IUniswapV3SwapCallback, IUniswapV3FlashCallback\n```\n\n### uniswap-v4@1.0.2::IUniswapV3SwapCallback::__contract__\n`uniswap-v4@1.0.2` · repo:46c6834698c48bc4a463a86d8420f4eb1d7f3b75 · as_of 2026-04-02T19:42:06Z\nhttps://github.com/Uniswap/v4-core/blob/46c6834698c48bc4a463a86d8420f4eb1d7f3b75/test/utils/V3Helper.sol#L32-L34\n\n```\ninterface IUniswapV3SwapCallback {\n    function uniswapV3SwapCallback(int256 amount0Delta, int256 amount1Delta, bytes calldata data) external;\n```\n\n### uniswap-v3@3.0.0::TestUniswapV3SwapPay::__contract__\n`uniswap-v3@3.0.0` · repo:d0831dc6b8a318df3872b6d68f6de135c9f3ec29 · as_of 2026-04-30T16:18:48Z\nhttps://github.com/Uniswap/v3-core/blob/d0831dc6b8a318df3872b6d68f6de135c9f3ec29/contracts/test/TestUniswapV3SwapPay.sol#L9-L41\n\n```\ncontract TestUniswapV3SwapPay is IUniswapV3SwapCallback {\n    function swap(\n```\n\n### uniswap-v3@3.0.0::UniswapV3PoolSwapTest::__contract__\n`uniswap-v3@3.0.0` · repo:d0831dc6b8a318df3872b6d68f6de135c9f3ec29 · as_of 2026-04-30T16:18:48Z\nhttps://github.com/Uniswap/v3-core/blob/d0831dc6b8a318df3872b6d68f6de135c9f3ec29/contracts/test/UniswapV3PoolSwapTest.sol#L9-L50\n\n```\ncontract UniswapV3PoolSwapTest is IUniswapV3SwapCallback {\n    int256 private _amount0Delta;\n```\n\n### uniswap-v3@3.0.0::TestUniswapV3Router::__contract__\n`uniswap-v3@3.0.0` · repo:d0831dc6b8a318df3872b6d68f6de135c9f3ec29 · as_of 2026-04-30T16:18:48Z\nhttps://github.com/Uniswap/v3-core/blob/d0831dc6b8a318df3872b6d68f6de135c9f3ec29/contracts/test/TestUniswapV3Router.sol#L11-L11\n\n```\ncontract TestUniswapV3Router is IUniswapV3SwapCallback\n```\n\n### uniswap-v3@3.0.0::TestUniswapV3ReentrantCallee::expectedReason\n`uniswap-v3@3.0.0` · repo:d0831dc6b8a318df3872b6d68f6de135c9f3ec29 · as_of 2026-04-30T16:18:48Z\nhttps://github.com/Uniswap/v3-core/blob/d0831dc6b8a318df3872b6d68f6de135c9f3ec29/contracts/test/TestUniswapV3ReentrantCallee.sol#L11-L21\n\n```\nstring private constant expectedReason = 'LOK';\nfunction swapToReenter(address pool) external\n(2 units in this chunk)\n```\n\n### uniswap-v3@3.0.0::TestUniswapV3ReentrantCallee::__contract__\n`uniswap-v3@3.0.0` · repo:d0831dc6b8a318df3872b6d68f6de135c9f3ec29 · as_of 2026-04-30T16:18:48Z\nhttps://github.com/Uniswap/v3-core/blob/d0831dc6b8a318df3872b6d68f6de135c9f3ec29/contracts/test/TestUniswapV3ReentrantCallee.sol#L10-L10\n\n```\ncontract TestUniswapV3ReentrantCallee is IUniswapV3SwapCallback\n```\n\n### uniswap-v4@1.0.2::V3Fuzzer::__contract__\n`uniswap-v4@1.0.2` · repo:46c6834698c48bc4a463a86d8420f4eb1d7f3b75 · as_of 2026-04-02T19:42:06Z\nhttps://github.com/Uniswap/v4-core/blob/46c6834698c48bc4a463a86d8420f4eb1d7f3b75/test/PoolManager.swap.t.sol#L20-L20\n\n```\nabstract contract V3Fuzzer is V3Helper, Deployers, Fuzzers, IUniswapV3MintCallback, IUniswapV3SwapCallback\n```\n\n### uniswap-v3@3.0.0::test.shared.fixtures::poolFixture\n`uniswap-v3@3.0.0` · repo:d0831dc6b8a318df3872b6d68f6de135c9f3ec29 · as_of 2026-04-30T16:18:48Z\nhttps://github.com/Uniswap/v3-core/blob/d0831dc6b8a318df3872b6d68f6de135c9f3ec29/test/shared/fixtures.ts#L57-L92\n\n```\nconst poolFixture: Fixture<PoolFixture> = async function (): Promise<PoolFixture> {\n  const { factory } = await factoryFixture()\n```\n\n⚠ **A validated recipe exists but was NOT served.** The question scopes to a project FAMILY, and a family names no single project — serving one human's signed recipe for a question that did not name their project would attribute their work to an answer they did not give. They are here:\n\n- `uniswap-v3`: recipe available (`exact-input-swap@70bc2e40`), pass `project: \"uniswap-v3\"` to receive it\n- `uniswap-v4`: recipe available (`hook-swap@4.0.0`), pass `project: \"uniswap-v4\"` to receive it\n"}],"structuredContent":{"intent":"integrate","recipe":null,"hits":[{"selector":"c49cc699-c623-5074-a9a1-249d7d65de5e","source_url":"https://github.com/Uniswap/v4-core/blob/46c6834698c48bc4a463a86d8420f4eb1d7f3b75/README.md#L44-L66","snippet":"Uniswap v4 Core › Repository Structure\nAll contracts are held within the `v4-core/src` folder.\n\nNote that helper contracts used by tests are held in the `v4-core/src/test` subfolder within the `src` folder. Any new test helper contracts should be added here, but all foundry tests are in the…","project":"uniswap-v4","version":"1.0.2","version_defaulted":false,"last_validated":"2026-08-13T03:54:35Z","as_of":"2026-04-02T19:42:06Z","provenance_kind":"repo","pin_ref":"46c6834698c48bc4a463a86d8420f4eb1d7f3b75"},{"selector":"uniswap-v3@3.0.0::TestUniswapV3Callee::__contract__","source_url":"https://github.com/Uniswap/v3-core/blob/d0831dc6b8a318df3872b6d68f6de135c9f3ec29/contracts/test/TestUniswapV3Callee.sol#L15-L15","snippet":"contract TestUniswapV3Callee is IUniswapV3MintCallback, IUniswapV3SwapCallback, IUniswapV3FlashCallback","project":"uniswap-v3","version":"3.0.0","version_defaulted":false,"last_validated":"2026-08-13T03:54:35Z","as_of":"2026-04-30T16:18:48Z","provenance_kind":"repo","pin_ref":"d0831dc6b8a318df3872b6d68f6de135c9f3ec29"},{"selector":"uniswap-v4@1.0.